{"overview":"Seeking a fresh start, chef Xu Fu travels to the Middle East to support his family and repay his debts. Alongside restaurant manager Ma Junsheng, he transforms the struggling Dragon Restaurant into a thriving business. But when war engulfs the city, their hard-won success is shattered and the restaurant becomes a refuge for those caught in the conflict. As danger closes in, Xu Fu must risk everything to protect his newfound community and preserve a small beacon of hope amid the devastation.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"Eat well, stay alive.","runtime":141,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["文牧野"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"沈腾","role":"Xu Fu","photo":"/h9l1fHqty8EdCqDWNWjO5tp48xZ.jpg"},{"name":"蒋奇明","role":"Ma Junsheng","photo":"/6OWIhJwjwiMWKBHcUTn7pglXEFx.jpg"},{"name":"عمر شريف","role":"Seif","photo":"/iSiOazDKO0tIChVnn79oJJGYTHp.jpg"},{"name":"李治廷","role":"Tony","photo":"/xIhutO65mdNEWKHusfvHZYTDITE.jpg"},{"name":"谢里夫·萨比","role":"Zayd","photo":"/bZMu6rlkJZpowmJVI4jrEEaFlPv.jpg"},{"name":"艾哈迈德·萨利姆","role":"Ali","photo":"/kTelqFGKE4sOTJv4c1UNLSdAFxh.jpg"},{"name":"法鲁克·穆罕穆德","role":"Jamal","photo":"/y0cCsjFvtraHnwCAsaTl9sBXPZT.jpg"},{"name":"Russell Shealy","role":"Morgan","photo":"/i5Dsun5rSHEMycSarzNenKAtapu.jpg"},{"name":"奈拉·阿克西姆","role":"Lina","photo":"/5TLstny2iZYTAMiw9Srcl6Euh8R.jpg"},{"name":"卡尔玛·哈齐姆","role":"Susu","photo":"/w5AMweXu8IYVTZn5mTcxAEuh2AC.jpg"},{"name":"苇青","role":"Xu's Mother","photo":"/on1BVc4NJwK03fToeMDGJl6d0Ad.jpg"},{"name":"张熙唯","role":"Xu Le","photo":"/dVUef87Q5Gc0X8yEcGPU9PchwP9.jpg"}],"trailer":"iHDNxZF7LRw","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1391021"}